    "Initial exploration shows a clear class imbalance, where certain ratings 1 and 5 stars dominate the dataset. Based on this observation, further steps should include addressing the class imbalance to ensure fair model performance.\n",
    "\n",
    "This can be done by applying techniques such as resampling ( oversampling minority classes or undersampling majority classes), using class weighting in model training, and selecting appropriate evaluation metrics such as precision, recall, and F1-score instead of relying solely on accuracy. Additionally, alternative problem formulations, such as grouping ratings into fewer classes (e.g., binary sentiment)\n"
   ]
